        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sum the resulting sequence",
      "body": "Inspect the coefficients you found. If they form an arithmetic progression, pair the first with the last or use the arithmetic-sum formula.",
      "recap": "An arithmetic sum equals the number of terms multiplied by the average of its first and last terms.",
      "pitfall": "Distinguish the number of summands in the expression from the number of nonzero contributions.",
