  "solution": "<p>The coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>, while the constant summand contributes 0.</p><p>Therefore the required coefficient is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mo>&#x022EF;</mo><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#x000D7;</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3240</mn></mrow></math>.</p><p><strong>Answer E.</strong></p>",
